<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="439915614"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1744963707"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="刚好遇见你"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="李玉刚"/><amll:meta key="album" value="刚好遇见你"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:57.164"><div begin="00:12.391" end="02:57.164"><p begin="00:12.391" end="00:18.660" itunes:key="L13654">我们哭了 我们笑着</p><p begin="00:18.670" end="00:21.732" itunes:key="L13655">我们抬头望天空</p><p begin="00:21.742" end="00:24.717" itunes:key="L13656">星星还亮着几颗</p><p begin="00:24.727" end="00:30.490" itunes:key="L13657">我们唱着 时间的歌</p><p begin="00:30.796" end="00:33.794" itunes:key="L13658">才懂得相互拥抱</p><p begin="00:33.804" end="00:37.085" itunes:key="L13659">到底是为了什么</p><p begin="00:37.095" end="00:40.571" itunes:key="L13660">因为我刚好遇见你</p><p begin="00:40.581" end="00:43.581" itunes:key="L13661">留下足迹才美丽</p><p begin="00:43.591" end="00:46.741" itunes:key="L13662">风吹花落泪如雨</p><p begin="00:46.751" end="00:49.701" itunes:key="L13663">因为 不想分离</p><p begin="00:49.711" end="00:52.947" itunes:key="L13664">因为刚好遇见你</p><p begin="00:52.957" end="00:55.918" itunes:key="L13665">留下十年的期许</p><p begin="00:55.928" end="00:59.084" itunes:key="L13666">如果再相遇 (再相遇)</p><p begin="00:59.094" end="01:02.734" itunes:key="L13667">我想我会记得你</p><p begin="01:14.005" end="01:19.978" itunes:key="L13668">我们哭了 我们笑着</p><p begin="01:20.118" end="01:23.334" itunes:key="L13669">我们抬头望天空</p><p begin="01:23.344" end="01:26.566" itunes:key="L13670">星星还亮着几颗</p><p begin="01:26.576" end="01:32.517" itunes:key="L13671">我们唱着 时间的歌</p><p begin="01:32.527" end="01:35.450" itunes:key="L13672">才懂得相互拥抱</p><p begin="01:35.460" end="01:38.626" itunes:key="